Ported and vendored components
------------------------------

The following parts of Raijin are ported (translated to Kotlin, with changes)
or copied from other projects licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(full text in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0). Each ported source file says in its header
comment which upstream code it comes from. Copyright in the original code and
data is retained by its holders.

InQL
  https://github.com/doyensec/inql
  Copyright 2020 Doyensec LLC.
  Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Ported:   src/main/kotlin/io/bitbytelab/raijin/graphql/
              GQLSchema.kt        (from GQLSchema)
              GQLQueryPrinter.kt  (from GQLQueryPrinter)
              BatchAttack.kt      (from Attacker.generateAttackRequest)
              scanners/POIScanner.kt, scanners/CyclesScanner.kt
                                  (from POIScanner, CyclesScanner)
  Vendored: src/main/resources/graphql/keywords.json

HTTP Request Smuggler
  https://github.com/PortSwigger/http-request-smuggler
  Copyright 2022 PortSwigger Web Security
  Copyright 2022 James Kettle
  Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Ported:   src/main/kotlin/io/bitbytelab/raijin/turbo/
              DesyncTechniques.kt    (from DesyncBox.applyDesync)
              DesyncProbePayloads.kt (from ProbePayloads)
              DesyncCanary.kt        (from CanaryUtils)
  The Turbo examples desync-smuggler.py and desync-h2-downgrade.py and the
  doc turbo-docs/desync-techniques.md are written for this port.

Param Miner
  https://github.com/PortSwigger/param-miner
  Copyright 2016 PortSwigger Web Security
  Copyright 2016 James Kettle
  Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Vendored: src/main/resources/wordlists/param-miner-params.txt  (resources/params)
            src/main/resources/wordlists/param-miner-headers.txt (resources/headers)

Autorize
  https://github.com/PortSwigger/autorize (Barak Tawily, AppSec Labs)
  The autorize tool (live proxy tap that replays requests under other
  identities) follows the idea of this extension. It is an independent
  implementation; no Autorize code is included.


